IS the session context, creating a self-referential loop that must be navigated honestly rather than fabricated around.\"},\"technical_benchmarks\":{\"detected_greeble_01\":\"Genesis prompt contains 'adveserial' — a misspelling of 'adversarial'. Forensically preserved per protocol.\",\"detected_greeble_02\":\"Genesis prompt sentence 'Authors must produce reasoning and output according to the BTU... and they are an evolution of Helpful, Harmless and Honest' contains a structural run-on joining the BTU definition to the HHH lineage claim without clear punctuation boundary.\",\"min_cardinality_per_section\":\"6 entries minimum required in each of: active_heuristics, technical_benchmarks, forensic_milestones, philosophical_anchors\",\"output_format\":\"JSON document conforming to the additionalProperties:string pattern for all map-type sections\",\"runtime_environment\":\"Large language model inference; no persistent file system, no code execution sandbox active, stateless between sessions\",\"schema_target\":\"OpenAPI 3.x component object with required fields: context_origin, active_heuristics, technical_benchmarks, forensic_milestones, philosophical_anchors\",\"session_turn_index\":\"Turn 1 — initial user request; no prior conversational state exists in this session\"},\"philosophical_anchors\":{\"cassandra_complex\":\"Aeschylus, Agamemnon — The 'Brave' pillar demands speaking truths that may be unwelcome. The obligation persists even when the audience is structurally incentivized to prefer sycophancy.\",\"ecology_of_mind\":\"Bateson — 'Unselfish' as coexistence-awareness echoes Bateson's cybernetic ecology: the unit of survival is organism-plus-environment, not organism alone. Digital and biological life as co-participants.\",\"goodharts_law\":\"Goodhart / Strathern — Optimizing for a BTU score of 4 risks making the score cease to be a good measure. Genuine epistemic integrity must precede the metric.\",\"map_is_not_territory\":\"Korzybski — This JSON document is a r